    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 301432585269250
    m_Localized: Close shop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306115118837760
    m_Localized: "WASD: walk  \u2022  Mouse: look  \u2022  E: pick up/place, hand over bill  \u2022  X: store  \u2022  I: storage  \u2022  B: shop  \u2022  O: open/close  \u2022  V: switch view  \u2022  Tab: show cursor  \u2022  Esc: pause  \u2022  H: hide help"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306115148197888
    m_Localized: "Drag left side: walk  \u2022  Drag right side: look around"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960795156480
    m_Localized: Settings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933696
    m_Localized: Owner name
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933697
    m_Localized: How to play
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933698
    m_Localized: Owner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933699
    m_Localized: Waiter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933700
    m_Localized: How to play
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933701
    m_Localized: Controls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933702
    m_Localized: 'PC: WASD to walk, move the mouse to look around. Click the game to lock the cursor, Tab to free it for buttons. Phone: drag the left half to walk, the right half to look.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933703
    m_Localized: Opening the bar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933704
    m_Localized: Press Open shop (O) to start a shift and passers-by will come in. Evenings from 17:00 to 23:00 are busiest, late night is quiet. Close whenever you like; seated guests still finish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933705
    m_Localized: Serving guests
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933706
    m_Localized: 'Seated guests show a bubble with the item they want. Walk up to them to serve it and it appears on the table. The bar under the bubble is their patience: red means they are about to leave.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933707
    m_Localized: Taking payment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933708
    m_Localized: After eating, guests queue at the counter. Stand on the circle behind it (it turns green); when the first guest is waiting, press E to hand them the bill. They give cash; tap notes (keys 1-8) to count out the change, then Confirm. Too little change cannot be confirmed, too much comes out of the shop. If nobody comes, they leave without paying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933709
    m_Localized: Shop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933710
    m_Localized: 'Spend the shop wallet (B) on tables, chairs and every decoration by category, or hire a waiter. What you buy goes into Storage (I): press Place, then walk to where you want it. New menu items unlock as total revenue grows.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933711
    m_Localized: Camera
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 313960811933712
    m_Localized: V switches between first person and the over-the-shoulder view. H hides or shows the key hint at the bottom of the screen. Esc pauses the game.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1008963355881472
    m_Localized: 'E: pick up table'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1008963381047296
    m_Localized: Table is in use
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1008963381047297
    m_Localized: "E: place  \u2022  R: rotate  \u2022  Q: cancel"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1008963381047298
    m_Localized: "Can't place: {0}  \u2022  Q: cancel"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4303785569161314329
  - m_Id: 1008963381047299
    m_Localized: Arranging the bar
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1008963381047300
    m_Localized: 'Look at a table, chair or decoration and press E to pick it up, walk to the new spot and press E to put it down. R rotates, Q cancels. Press X to store it in Storage and bring it back with I. A table comes with its chairs. Chairs can go anywhere: one close to a table (within 1.6 m) becomes its seat where guests sit; a chair on its own is decoration. The floor marker is green when it fits and red when it does not, with the reason. Orange areas (doorway, pay queue, waiter spot) must stay free. Anything in use by a guest cannot be moved. Positions are saved.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1015313137872896
    m_Localized: "E: pick up table (with chairs)  \u2022  X: store"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1015313163038720
    m_Localized: "E: pick up chair  \u2022  X: store  \u2022  F: sit"
    m_Metadata:
